  <name>Nubo Office</name>
  <summary>Documents, spreadsheets, slides</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Nubo Office is a free office suite for your own computer. Write letters and reports, calculate in spreadsheets, build presentations and draw diagrams, all without an account and without sending your files anywhere.</p>
    <p>It has four apps in one:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Nubo Write for documents, reports and forms</li>
      <li>Nubo Cells for spreadsheets, charts and data tools</li>
      <li>Nubo Present for slide shows with themes, transitions and notes</li>
      <li>Nubo Draw for diagrams, flowcharts and drawings</li>
    </ul>
    <p>It opens and saves the files you already have: .docx, .xlsx and .pptx, the open formats .odt, .ods and .odp, plain text and CSV, and exports any document to PDF. It works offline and has no advertising and no tracking.</p>
    <p>Nubo Office is made by Nubo and built on the open source Collabora Online and LibreOffice technology. Collabora and LibreOffice are trademarks of their owners; Nubo Office is not made or endorsed by them.</p>
  </description>
